{"version":1,"content":"<p>時值《仙劍奇俠傳四》問世十九周年，《仙劍奇俠傳四：重製版》官方公佈項目最新開發進度，宣佈2026年12月5日將在安徽合肥濱湖國際會展中心4號館舉辦「尋仙之夜」仙劍嘉年華。本次活動對公眾免費開放，分為室內主題晚會與室外沉浸式遊園會兩大板塊，遊園無需預約，內場晚會則需要提前預約鎖票，到場參與晚會的玩家還可領取專屬伴手禮。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/game/1584138.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T07:21:56.060820+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":164,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T06:57:51+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T07:18:16.239923+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T07:18:16.239923+00:00","content_hash":"623f1888dc0ba5de2fbcd54cd7bfcd8771812de3d7ab20ba00b8c55cc3d1a17e","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}